#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Writes palette.json and theme.toml for the generated themes.

Each theme below lists its colours once per variant (dark/light); this script
expands them into Noctalia's palette roles and terminal colours. Moonlit,
Ember, Tide and Paper are hand-written and not touched.

  tools/make-themes            # rewrite every generated theme
  tools/make-themes nord       # just one

Every theme's design tokens (tokens.json) are rewritten afterwards by
tools/make-tokens, since they follow the palettes.

Colours of the upstream-based themes come from each project's published
palette (licences in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md).
"""
